simulate_ccat.py — FYST/Prime-Cam 850 GHz (353 um), GPD tail of the CIB
==================================================================================
FORECAST ARM.  No data exist; every instrument number traces to
CCAT-prime Collaboration (2023) Table 1.  Band = 850 GHz, NOT the
Prime-Cam channel named '350 GHz' (857 um, 37" beam).
