    -> our Herschel-to-CCAT flux gain is 2.1x; the CCAT paper claims ~3x from
       Bethermin et al. (2017).  We are the more conservative of the two.

  Dynamic range S_cut / sigma_c = 21.0 (Schechter), against 12.5 at Herschel and 1.1 at Planck.
