CCAT — weather leg: sigma_N = 4.9 mJy/beam (Q1-Q3 average)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The Q1 value assumes the DSFG survey runs in best-quartile PWV, which the paper
  states as the plan.  The weather-averaged depth is 58% worse, and at 850 GHz the
  atmosphere is the dominant term, so this leg brackets the realistic outcome.
